<hi rendition="#aq">II.</hi> <hi rendition="#g">Freye Handlungen. &#x2014; Hinderni&#x017F;&#x017F;e</hi>: <hi rendition="#aq">A.</hi> <hi rendition="#g">Alters-<lb/>
