<hi rendition="#aq">quod vi</hi> <note place="foot" n="(k)"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">L.</hi> 15 § 6 <hi rendition="#i">quod vi</hi></hi> (43. 24.).</note>.</p>           <lb/>
