<list>             <item>               <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">L.</hi> 10 <hi rendition="#i">C. h. t.</hi> &#x201E;Cum quis <hi rendition="#i">jus ignorans</hi> indebitam pe-<lb/>
