<item>               <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">L.</hi> 6 <hi rendition="#i">C. de cond. ind.</hi> (4. 5.) &#x201E;Si per <hi rendition="#i">ignorantiam facti</hi><lb/>
